'
' 🧱 File: component_with_flags.puml
' ------------------------------
' 📌 Purpose   : Component Diagram — Slice 1 Logging & Error Backbone (with FeatureFlagsManager)
' 🧱 Layer     : Documentation (PlantUML)
' 👤 Author    : Mohamed Ali
' 🗓️ Created   : 2025-09-04
'
' 🧠 Description:
' Updated component diagram for Slice 1 to include the FeatureFlagsManager
' as a runtime configuration subsystem. Shows relations between QML layer,
' ErrorReporter, LogManager, AppErrors, and FeatureFlagsManager.
'

@startuml
!define USE_CUSTOM_THEME
!include ../../config/style.puml
title Component — Slice 1 Logging & Error Backbone (with FeatureFlagsManager)

' ==== UI Layer ====
FA6_DESKTOP(qml, "QML Views", rectangle, #2AA1D1)
FA6_BELL(toast, "Toast.qml", rectangle, #E5C55F)
FA6_CIRCLE_EXCLAMATION(fallback, "SmartFallback.qml", rectangle, #E5C55F)

' ==== Application Layer ====
FA6_CUBES(errors, "AppErrors", rectangle, #9C27B0)
FA6_TRIANGLE_EXCLAMATION(reporter, "ErrorReporter", rectangle, #03A9F4)
FA6_SLIDERS(flags, "FeatureFlagsManager", rectangle, #607D8B)

' ==== Infrastructure Layer ====
FA6_FILE(logmgr, "LogManager", rectangle, #FF9800)

' ==== Relations ====
qml --> reporter : report(error,severity)
reporter --> logmgr : log(level,msg,ctx)
reporter --> toast : toastRequested
reporter --> fallback : on failure
reporter --> flags : check features.logging
logmgr --> flags : check features.logging

@enduml
